<body>
<div class="card">
<h2>🌾 Shared Harvest Mitigation Hub</h2>
<p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#cbd5e1; margin:0 0 15px 0;">Transforming landowner friction points into structured legal and technical solutions.</p>

<div class="section-title">🚨 Friction & Strategic Solutions</div>

<div class="complaint-box">
<b>⚠️ The "Junkyard" Effect & Noise Chaos</b><br>
Landowners cancel leases when sites look messy or machinery runs too early.<br>
<a class="action-link" href="hub-conduct-mou.html">→ Deploy Code of Conduct & MOU Lease Template</a>
</div>

<div class="complaint-box">
<b>⚠️ Water Over-Use & Mapping Disputes</b><br>
Unmonitored irrigation valves or boundary creeping causes massive legal fights.<br>
<a class="action-link" href="hub-mapping-water.html">→ Deploy Precision Map & Water Infrastructure Log</a>
</div>

<div class="complaint-box">
<b>⚠️ Bookkeeping Flaws & Trust Deficits</b><br>
Failing to clearly prove harvest weight metrics breaks the 30/70 crop-share agreement.<br>
<a class="action-link" href="hub-intake-references.html">→ Deploy Yield Forms & Partner Reference Pack</a>
</div>

<a href="index.html?v=2" class="btn-exit">Return to Master Dashboard</a>
